Supplier output parent prerequisite
===================================

Before issuing the first supplier call, Root must create and verify the
ordinary canonical directory:

  /private/tmp/l026_prime_cycle_supplier/instances/first_window

The final child output/ must still be absent. Walk the existing ancestry
before mkdir, refuse symlinks, and verify parent.resolve(strict=True)==parent
afterward. The supplier then creates output/ exclusively. Its frozen plan
and Source check this final parent only after search, so satisfying this
prerequisite avoids spending an otherwise valid search on an unusable output
location. This note issues no Root gate and changes no Source or plan.
